# Exception: the SWIG shadow header regen.sh depends on is hand-patched and
# not reproducible from scratch, so it must be tracked despite the blanket
# `include/` rule above. Git won't apply file-level negations inside a
# directory an earlier pattern already excludes, so every path segment down
# to the file needs its own negation.
!sci_gateway/c/swig/include/
!sci_gateway/c/swig/include/opencv2/
!sci_gateway/c/swig/include/opencv2/core/
!sci_gateway/c/swig/include/opencv2/core/cvstd_wrapper.hpp
